  "plain": "Brandon Fugal, the businessman who owns Skinwalker Ranch in Utah, says a reporter named Steven Greenstreet at the New York Post questioned his account of meeting Sean Kirkpatrick, who led AARO, the Pentagon office set up to look into UFO reports. Fugal tells Michels, \"I was being made out to be the liar,\" and says he answered by posting photos of the meeting as proof. If his account holds, it would mean the head of the Pentagon's UFO office really did meet the owner of a ranch famous for strange events."
